  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Sales By Representative Expanded View PDF is a single flat table containing every representative and every invoice together. There is no page break between representatives, no per-representative totals row, and it ends with one grand Totals row that this file is specifically not supposed to have."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "It also comes out on A3 paper rather than A4."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com), build v3.5-7168d14. Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Sales By Representative."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the three-dot download menu and choose the Expanded View PDF."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the file: look for a page break between representatives, for a totals row at the end of each representative's block, and at the last page."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Take the Summary PDF from the same menu and compare the paper size. The named test data: sales representatives ZZAUTOTEST RepA (one invoice, S-16244) and ZZAUTOTEST RepB (three invoices, S-16243, S-16242, S-16241), plus Parth Fadadu (one invoice, S-15826); customers Aaborough Works, Aacastle Services, Aachester Partners, Aacrest Works and Beman Systems; both locations, Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 and Staging Lethbridge - 4310."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The file is one flat table across all representatives, with no page breaks, no per-representative totals rows, and a single grand Totals row at the end. It measures 1190 by 842 points, which is A3; the Summary PDF from the same menu and the same filters is 842 by 595, which is A4."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Every figure in the file is correct, and the footer and logo are present on both files, so this is specific to the Expanded file. It is unusable as a per-representative handout, which is what this download exists for, and it will shrink or crop on ordinary office paper."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "One block per representative, a page break before each new representative after the first, the header strip repeated on each, and a totals row at the end of every block \u2014 with no grand totals row anywhere in the file. On A4."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Sales By Representative report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/585629698/SBR+Sales+By+Representative+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 17, requirement S14-R6: \u201cExpanded View PDF \u2014 one page-block per rep, in the currently-active order (S14-R2a), page break before each new rep after the first, each with the header strip (which already includes the selected date range per S14-R3), the rep's name, and a per-invoice table\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same requirement closes both remaining points: \"Each block ends with a per-rep totals row (\"Totals\" in the Date cell; Invoice/Customer/Status blank; each metric column aggregated as in S14-R5, Margin % recomputed). There is no grand-totals row across all reps.\""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
